WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.878
Hey! Where are we going?!

00:00:05.964 --> 00:00:07.340
Wait up here. I'll be right back.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.051
Why is she so bossy?

00:00:18.476 --> 00:00:20.145
Don't peek, you pervert!

00:00:20.895 --> 00:00:23.606
Why are guys always so stupid and horny?!

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:33.324
Okay, Asuka... it's game time.

00:00:40.582 --> 00:00:41.708
Why can't we sink it?!

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:44.210
I guess only an Eva can beat those things.

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:51.509
Okay, let's get out there.

00:00:52.677 --> 00:00:54.721
You, too! You're coming with me!

00:00:57.182 --> 00:01:00.560
Hey, why did we get changed
into plug suits?!

00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:01.644
Are you an idiot?

00:01:02.103 --> 00:01:05.273
Why do you think? We're going to
take that thing out with my Unit 02!

00:01:06.775 --> 00:01:09.194
Is that okay? Shouldn't we get
Ms. Misato's permission?

00:01:09.861 --> 00:01:11.613
I'll get her permission after my victory.

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:18.703
Okay, I'm going to show you
how a real pilot does it.

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:21.039
But don't cause any trouble, got it?

00:01:26.795 --> 00:01:29.422
That's strange... It's almost
like it's looking for something.

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:34.636
Getting attacked by an Angel out here
wasn't part of the deal.

00:01:34.886 --> 00:01:39.057
That is why Unit 02 is there.
I even sent a backup pilot.

00:01:40.225 --> 00:01:43.812
If it comes down to it,
escape on your own.

00:01:44.687 --> 00:01:45.688
Understood.

00:01:48.691 --> 00:01:50.693
[speaking German]

00:02:04.499 --> 00:02:06.084
There's a bug. What's wrong?

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:09.129
Cognitive noise!
I told you not to cause trouble, didn't I?

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:10.421
What did I do?

00:02:10.505 --> 00:02:14.676
You're thinking in Japanese, aren't you?
Think in German, damn it!

00:02:14.926 --> 00:02:16.594
Oh, okay...

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:18.471
Um, Baumkuchen--

00:02:18.596 --> 00:02:20.431
Idiot! All right, fine!

00:02:20.849 --> 00:02:23.810
Change cognitive linguistics!
Set basic to Japanese!

00:02:26.855 --> 00:02:29.274
Evangelion Unit 02! Activate!

00:02:30.108 --> 00:02:32.694
Message from the Othello:
Eva-02 is activating!

00:02:33.111 --> 00:02:34.028
It's what?!

